 "findings": [
  "GoDaddy Website Builder site, copyright 2021; the shop name is written in lowercase (\"tenney mtn pizza\") and cut off in the footer.",
  "Homepage is the same sentence repeated five times (\"Welcome to tenney mtn pizza Tenney Mtn Pizza in Plymouth\").",
  "Menu pages list items with almost no prices, so customers cannot see what anything costs.",
  "Builder placeholders left live: \"Add a footnote if this applies to your business\" and \"Add a description about this item\" (twice).",
  "\"About Us\" page is completely empty; \"Photo Gallery\" and \"Social\" sections have little or nothing in them.",
  "No online ordering; phone only. Delivery is \"subject to driver availability\".",
  "Typos: \"Ceaser Salad\", \"Chedder\", and \"French\" listed twice in the dressings.",
  "A spammy third-party \"Unofficial Website\" (tenneymountainpizza.com) with fake filler text and euro prices competes in search results."
 ],
 "questions": [
  "What are the full weekly hours? The site only shows \"Open today 11:00 am - 08:00 pm\".",
  "Can you send current prices for every item? The shop menu lists none, and the new site says \"call for pricing\" until we have them.",
  "Is the $4.00 \"Additional Toppings\" price per topping, and does it apply to every topping on that list?",
  "What are the delivery area, fee and minimum, and how should we word \"subject to driver availability\"?",
  "Is the history of the shop something you want to tell (who started it, how long it has been open)? The About Us page is empty.",
  "Do you want online ordering, or stay phone-only? Is there an email for the contact form?",
  "Can you confirm we may reuse the photos from your website and Instagram? We did not use the staff photo, the signed jersey or the Halloween photo.",
  "Is the pepperoni hero photo your own?"
 ]
}